{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "english", "appid": 553850, "month": "2026-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1771200000, "end_date": 1771891199, "month_true_total": 9201, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:17:51 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "219080576", "author": {"steamid": "76561198155757360", "personaname": "abettermind", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198155757360/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 813, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 319, "last_played": 1772229886, "avatar": "1c01c351e3d0df03d31d170a851345c50325bcfb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Ever wanted to be a lore-accurate communist disguised as a freedom-loving patriot who stacks bodies while your people suffer casualties that would make even the most successful communists in history blush? If so, your fantasy utopia has been realized, and Super Earth awaits your service! \r\nFOR DEMOCRACY!!!!", "timestamp_created": 1771890905, "timestamp_updated": 1771890905, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219080218", "author": {"steamid": "76561199331134886", "personaname": "BruhMoment", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199331134886/", "num_games_owned": 82, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 729, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 729, "last_played": 1771875094, "avatar": "e5e5008c21215e4c3ebf4b35ff339342f0ccdc36"}, "language": "english", "review": "Dark souls 2 has some competition on this one to which one is the worst game\r\nway too many buttons to focus on keyboard and theres little to no satisfaction of completing a level becuase the game is too slow, definitely my worst games of all time and extremely overrated", "timestamp_created": 1771890503, "timestamp_updated": 1771890503, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.475778579711914062", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219079873", "author": {"steamid": "76561198349391140", "personaname": "PokeFan08", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198349391140/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 3441, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1898, "last_played": 1779044351, "avatar": "973be9da7bf7afec5de8d8784f7551a40fd12b24"}, "language": "english", "review": "> Land on Planet during an eradication mission\r\n> Absolute Anarchy\r\n> Teammates are dead\r\n> Try to reinforce, out of reinforcements\r\n> Robot finds me\r\n> Staredown\r\n> Forced to bite curb by a Hulk\r\n> Die\r\n\r\n10/10 would helldive again", "timestamp_created": 1771890143, "timestamp_updated": 1771890143, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219079439", "author": {"steamid": "76561198798160777", "personaname": "Dah Treefer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198798160777/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 2939, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1589, "last_played": 1773017249, "avatar": "757000e3692c9975424ecdb8b85ae8512797fbf2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Dope Game", "timestamp_created": 1771889611, "timestamp_updated": 1771889611, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219079346", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018657871", "personaname": "Arby631", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198018657871/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 11739, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 345, "playtime_at_review": 10859, "last_played": 1787530189, "avatar": "6330c0531c83e7262767b52a29728f6801bcc289"}, "language": "english", "review": "Ultimately, the developers of this game are hamstrung somewhere. They took a great idea with good execution, and have followed it up with 24 months of mostly milquetoast additions. What felt good then now feels meh. Every ray of sunshine in this game has been beaten into an ineffectual hierarchy.  Arrowhead feels like they are out of touch with the players and incapable of getting back to the fundamentals of what made the game good. \n\nRupture strain released in a broken state. Now its fixed and just a PITA that invalidates most primary & secondary weapons. Caves broke orbital deployments and they are still not fixed. Flying bile titans released broken. There was a glitch where you could not get complete credit because some objectives just did not spawn. It's like a Bethesda game without the charm. They hired another studio just to create warbonds for the players because they are stretched so thin internally. \n\nI've lost faith in this game to return to a fun state of play.", "timestamp_created": 1771889513, "timestamp_updated": 1771889513, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}]}